%N A399270 Number of nonnegative integer solutions to the equation x^2 + 9*y^2 = n.
%H A399270 Seiichi Manyama, <a href="/A399270/b399270.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..10000</a>
%F A399270 G.f.: (1 + theta_3(q))*(1 + theta_3(q^9))/4, where theta_3() is the Jacobi theta function. - _Ilya Gutkovskiy_, Sep 03 2026
%o A399270 (PARI) a(n, k=9) = sum(i=0, sqrtint(n), sum(j=0, sqrtint(n\k), i^2+k*j^2==n));
%Y A399270 Cf. A000925, A216282, A119395, A399197, A216283, A216513, A216512, A399266.
%K A399270 nonn,easy,new
%O A399270 0,10
%A A399270 _Seiichi Manyama_, Aug 25 2026
